{"title":"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/6521ad84932f05bbfa1185b24d793813c7aefc2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, C, D,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are collinear in that order such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5c62e15b43007e231fb7639233e0f17b77e5a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = BC = 1, CD = 2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"190\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/3/fd39eb7263b933105241ddde26a9a38a572282a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE = 9$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> can be any point in space, what is the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c8cb0f4c0b7084f86f2abf2a86378b253962f8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP^2 + BP^2 + CP^2 + DP^2 + EP^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"268\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the altitude from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> onto <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> have lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/a/9ba8896ba9d428d251b31c62909f311805922555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ = h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6b3882f3c3025d2db3cdc7f39c1ca69415b64ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AQ = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" />.  It is clear that, for a given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> value, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3bb4eeb347e74e025fd175c22f1f7275af0555e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f874b39870586f0504f50a667f2bafedddf47904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/3/d13fd509f3062449aaea6e10e1040b1d585063f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CP$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/3/783d500281f8f46167dff3b071c543d42150e67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DP$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/6/f06175de06075b060abdf04ebd2ecfe88e58fc97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EP$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> are all minimized when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/5/62519da5d0d37130e671e9b4bc4218e71a147bd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h = 0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />, and therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a66206dedaef978be2e53d554484b8a0b58fcf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3bb4eeb347e74e025fd175c22f1f7275af0555e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />=r, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b24b21daa13e3947676f2e2d97c93bc2b79e1911.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP = |r - 1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/759abee5810049bec2d8058f62f4b3c205d9c6a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CP = |r - 2|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/8/e6842b18c3c3880d8fda66149442395a62e0e126.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DP = |r - 4|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/9648079e3e1abfcbafc49d0a814e0a2b32a0f182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EP = |r - 13|.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />  Squaring each of these gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/8/a28e2966bdfcb1b1e2fb4ed93e34e36c6a311698.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP^2 + BP^2 + CP^2 + DP^2 + EP^2 = r^2 + (r - 1)^2 + (r - 2)^2 + (r - 4)^2 + (r - 13)^2 = 5r^2 - 40r + 190$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"805\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>This reaches its minimum at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6e502de538e8a6c8bf42e4a3c1a6b7a6c29165c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac {40}{2\\cdot 5} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"101\" height=\"37\" />, at which point the sum of the squares of the distances is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b03c35a90600f596e2ba81d4e2ea911e2505a32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{110}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=14769\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018035831\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 215/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1422/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 180/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5051/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.114      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    7.114      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6599:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018035831 and revision id 70957. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}